d to strive to raise  happy children despite the circumstances  she even called maguire  the best co-parent a girl could have we  really share in everything he's amazing  he's the greatest dad in the world he  may not play the popularity game but  toby maguire has certainly shown a  penchant for entertainment of a  different sort  gambling as far back as 2011 cnn  reported that mr maguire had to settle a  lawsuit to prevent having to pay back  the sum of three hundred and eleven  thousand dollars that he had won a few  years earlier  the problem the money had been stolen  from investors by an illegal ponzi  scheme  while all mcguire did was accidentally  win the money being in the headlines  because you're connected with stolen  cash isn't quite the same kind of  popularity one gets from playing a  beloved childhood superhero but  maguire's gambling issues went deeper  than simply winning stolen money they  were put on much more damning display  through the book and movie adaptation  molly's game which followed the real  life story of molly bloom as she  organized underground poker games for a  host of rich players  including one player x played by michael  cera in the film  the unnamed gambler who happens to be a  jerk that enjoys destroying the lives of  his fellow players can easily be  connected to maguire from winning stolen  money to his overall sinister reputation  as a player maguire's gambling has  hardly done his reputation any favors  when he's not gambling or tending to his  kids toby maguire is still first and  foremost an entertainer but while  earlier in his career that primarily  meant acting  recently maguire has begun to spin off  more and more in a different direction  as a producer  it's not uncommon for a popular actor to  attempt to leverage their successful  career in front of the camera into one  behind it  it started with big shots like charlie  chaplin and has continued right through  to modern legends like clint eastwood  interestingly it'