20  christopher miller revealed  that we pitched the sony brass an  ambitious tag involving spider-ham toby  andrew and tom  they felt it was too soon into the  spider-verse was already jam-packed with  multi-dimensional surprises  but the fact that there were actual  plans in development to involve the  three live-action members of the sony  spider-man universe of characters is  exciting even just to think about  unfortunately it never materialized  interestingly enough a quick cameo and  into the spiderburst wasn't toby  maguire's only potential lifeline to a  superhero past  in a 2019 interview with the hollywood  reporter maguire was asked if he would  ever dawn a superhero suit again to  which he gave the nebulous response  i just don't really have an i would or  wouldn't do mindset i'll just do  whatever  whatever it is that comes that i feel  called to that may or may not fit in any  kind of box  while it's not really a straight answer  it's also definitively not to denial of  future cinematic heroics  in fact mcguire's open mindset seems to  leave the door wide open for a return if  a studio manages to woo him in just the  right way  it's something that the modern crossover  happy multiverse minded superhero  universes could certainly look to  capitalize on in the future  considering the increasingly surprising  list of stars set to appear in  spider-man no way home  there's certainly a possibility of  maguire pulling on the tights again for  a quick cameo  there are plenty of new professional  projects and important life events  keeping toby maguire out of hollywood  but there are also a few non-film  hobbies that he's admitted to investing  time in  when asked by the hollywood reporter  what he's done in his downtime maguire  headlined his list of leisure pursuits  with playing pickleball with his friends  he added that he also enjoys hanging out  with his kids and going skiing  which are both pretty normal ways to  spend your spare time then he casually  added one more item to the list  competitive puzzling that's right  maguire spends significant portions of  his spare time putting puzzles together  as quickly as he can  is his hobby taking the time and energy  he would otherwise be putting into  acting  toby maguire's shift to working behind  the camera might have initially looked  like the type of dabbling many actors do  when they reach a certain level of  success  but over the years maguire's managed to  find an increasing level of success as a  producer  material pictures gave maguire an  opportunity to break away from acting  while simultaneously maintaining his  passion for the entertainment industry  untethered from concerns for his  on-camera career maguire began to focus  more intently on behind-the-scenes work  and his new production company slowly  started to gain some traction by 2019  the studio which produced three films  that year finally found noteworthy  success  one of the films get duked won the  midnighters audience award at south by  southwest  while another brittany runs a marathon  was purchased by amazon for an  impressive 14 million dollars and went  on to earn critical acclaim with success  finally materializing for material the  chances of maguire stepping back into  the hollywood limelight seemed to grow  slimmer with each passing year  toby maguire last found his way in front  of a camera way back in 2014  his voice is heard alongside alec  baldwins and dreamworks 2017 animated  hit the boss baby but apart from that  he's remained hidden behind the camera  when asked by the hollywood reporter if  he was retired from acting though  maguire once again gave a hazy answer  declaring  i'll do what i feel called to do i  suspect i'll be excited when i do it  like just whenever the calling appears i  guess  while mcguire may not consider his  acting career dead in the water the  truth is he may have a bit of a long  road ahead of him if he ever wants to  start landing larger jobs in hollywood  again  the question that really needs to be  asked is whether maguire wants that in  the first place  clearly since he hung up his spidey  suits he seems to have his hands pretty  full simply being a father and producing  movies with an occasional cameo or  supporting role added in perhaps we'll  see the ex-superhero hit the big leagues  once again but that seems to be a  possibility that depends as much on his  wishes as it does on anything else  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite actors are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

